e, and prepared unto every good work.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙFlee also youthful lusts: but follow righteousness, faith, charity, peace, with them that call on the Lord out of a pure heart.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book6§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses”„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙOBut foolish and unlearned questions avoid, knowing that they do gender strifes.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ_And the servant of the Lord must not strive; but be gentle unto all men, apt to teach, patient,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ†in meekness instructing those that oppose themselves; if God peradventure will give them repentance to the acknowledging of the truth;¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙmand that they may recover themselves out of the snare of the devil, who are taken captive by him at his will.¦layout ªlast_verse